    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Design</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/time-based-key-value-store/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 981</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Time Based Key-Value Store</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Hash map from key to a list of (time, value), appended by set(). Set times only grow, so each list is already sorted and get() is a floor search: the last entry with time &lt;= t, found by upper bound minus one. set O(1), get O(log n), O(n) memory.</p>\n"
